ciency.\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ComponentWatch\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"AI PC Builds — Local LLM &amp; Inference | ComponentWatch\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Small-form-factor PC builds optimized for local AI: Ollama, LM Studio, Stable Diffusion, and ComfyUI. Real benchmarks, VRAM data, and power efficiency.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen text-ink flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-line/60 bg-[#08080f]/80 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 max-w-content items-center justify-between px-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold tracking-tight\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm tracking-tight group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity hidden sm:block\">ComponentWatch</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-0.5\"><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/compare\">Prices</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-surface\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors bg-surface text-ink\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\"><a class=\"rounded-lg bg-accent px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit build</a><a class=\"rounded-lg border border-line px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:border-line/80 transition-colors\" href=\"/sign-in\">Sign in</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12\"><div class=\"relative rounded-2xl border border-accent/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/8 via-transparent to-transparent p-10 mb-12 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_80%_at_0%_0%,rgba(77,142,240,0.08)_0%,transparent_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-3\">Local AI</p><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-ink mb-3\">SFF builds for local AI</h1><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Running Ollama, LM Studio, ComfyUI, or Stable Diffusion locally? VRAM is everything. These compact builds pack high-end GPUs into cases under 20L — always-on and powerful enough for serious inference workloads.</p></div></div><section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-12\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-2\">VRAM first</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">For 7B models: 8 GB minimum. For 13B+: 16 GB. For 70B quantized: 24 GB+. The RTX 3090/4090 with 24 GB VRAM is the gold standard for local LLM work.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-2\">Thermal efficiency matters</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Small cases concentrate heat. Look for builds where GPU stress temps stay under 80 °C — sustained inference loads run hotter than games. Check the thermal headroom column.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-2\">Power draw</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">A 4090 pulls 450 W under load. In a small case on a 300 W PSU that&#x27;s a problem. Check power draw figures against each build&#x27;s PSU rating before replicating.</p></div></section><section><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-6\">Builds with high-VRAM GPUs<span class=\"ml-2 text-sm font-normal text-ink-muted\">(<!-- -->36<!-- --> found)</span></h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(77,142,240,0.07)] transition-all duration-200 p-5\" href=\"/builds/190\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-accent transition-colors truncate\">ASUS A21</p><span class=\"text-[11px] text-ink-faint\">43.9<!-- -->L</span></div><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[9px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sff-green bg-sff-green/10 rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\">Benchmarked</span></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 mb-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted truncate\"><span class=\"text-[9px] text-ink-faint uppercase tracking-wide mr-1.5 font-semibold\">CPU</span>Ryzen 7 7800x3d</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted truncate\"><span class=\"text-[9px] text-ink-faint uppercase tracking-wide mr-1.5 font-semibold\">GPU</span>ASUS ROG Strix RTX 4090 24GB OC White</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-2 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[9px] text-ink-faint uppercase tracking-wide font-medium\">CB23</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-ink tabular-nums mt-0.5\">17,626</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg bg-surface-alt px-3 py-2 min-w-[64px]\"><span class=\"text-[9px] text-ink-faint uppercase tracking-wide fon